            "detailed_description": "You awake on an unknown planet with amnesia.<br />\r\nWhat are those horrific monsters?<br />\r\nWho are these mysterious priestesses?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou will explore a bizarre, grotesque and captivating world filled with surprises.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nInspired by cult classics such as &quot;Another World/Out of this World&quot;, &quot;Flashback&quot; and other cult classics, Dogolrax aims to surprise you in ways few games have before by introducing constant changes in gameplay, environment, monsters, dialog and plot twists.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExpect the unexpected plus a good dose of humor, gore, tease and varied gameplay.",
