                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I had seen this game on Xbox Live arcade and the image of poorly drawn anime tiddies had always intrigued me...\n\nBut buying this game is like playing a flash game from 2007. It's SO weird, but also oddly nostalgic. Like your playing a sick game on Kongregate or Stickpage that your group of friends haven't seen yet. \n\nI think it's like a quirkus little time capsule, and if you enjoy just weird stuff with endearing amounts of effort put into them, you'll enjoy this.",
